- Jetpack

After finally claiming the bounty on Han Solo's head, Boba stayed with Jabba to make sure he was executed.
He enjoyed his stay and kept an eye on some trouble makers, but never actually expected anyone to escape from the executions.
Imagine his surprise when someone did."